  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 散点图 + 拟合曲线，适合后处理数据绘图 *)\r\ndata = Table[{i, i + RandomReal[{-0.4, 0.4}]}, {i, 0, 10, 0.5}];\r\nfit = Fit[data, {1, x}, x];\r\nplot = Show[\r\n    ListPlot[data, PlotStyle -> {Red, PointSize[Medium]}, PlotLegends -> {\"采样点\"}],\r\n    Plot[fit, {x,0,10}, PlotStyle -> Blue, PlotLegends -> {\"线性拟合\"}],\r\n    PlotTheme -> \"Scientific\",\r\n    GridLines -> Automatic,\r\n    AxesLabel -> {\"X\", \"Y\"}\r\n];\r\nExport[\"scatter_fit.png\", plot, ImageResolution -> 300];\r\nplot",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wexpr\"><wgraph class=\"resizable\" style=\"width:484px;height:253px;\" aspect-ratio=\"0.5223\" tabIndex=\"-1\"><img class=\"invert-brightness\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" /></wgraph></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      }
     ],
